;;;; FIRST genuine higher inductive type with a non-trivial 2-cell: the 2-sphere
;;;; S^2 = (base : pt) + (surf : a square whose entire boundary is refl base).
;;;; That is the real S^2 -- a point and a SURFACE -- not Sigma S^1 of opaque
