;;;; with the point-beta  rec @ base = v  and surf landing on a genuine 2-cell.
;;;;
;;;; THE WALL (honest, located -- and since inc10, RECEDED).  This file builds
;;;; the surf GENERATOR of pi_2(S^2) structurally (surf is a non-trivial 2-cell,
;;;; so S^2 is NOT a set).  When written it left pi_2(S^2)=Z stalled for lack of
